            "typeName": "dataSources",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Former vmbo (preporatory vocational) students from The Hague and suburbs (N=273). The follow-up study was conducted during the autumn and winter of 2006/2007. This time, respondents were approached and surveyed at their home address and not in the classroom. The reason was that almost all of the respondents had left the secondary school where they participated in the original study."
            ]
